1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,650
What’s new in Island Time 1.22.1, shown with mock game data.

2
00:00:06,650 --> 00:00:11,770
The island map now has Anderson Island’s true outline.

3
00:00:11,770 --> 00:00:17,240
The ferry landing, the store and the lakes are where you’d find them.

4
00:00:17,240 --> 00:00:22,479
The mainland map runs from DuPont up to Point Defiance.

5
00:00:22,479 --> 00:00:28,009
Both landings are in view, so you can watch the boat cross.

6
00:00:28,009 --> 00:00:33,000
Visitors from Seattle get a map tab for their home city.

7
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:38,800
Your place, your job and the store, on the real shoreline.

8
00:00:38,800 --> 00:00:44,269
Olympia gets its own tab as well, around Budd Inlet.

9
00:00:44,269 --> 00:00:48,769
Tap any place to see the ways to get there.

10
00:00:48,769 --> 00:00:53,269
The title screen now has a What’s new button.

11
00:00:53,269 --> 00:00:57,769
It shows a “new” tag until you’ve read it.

12
00:00:57,769 --> 00:01:02,860
Each release lists its changes and plays a short video.

13
00:01:02,860 --> 00:01:07,360
Earlier releases are listed underneath.

14
00:01:07,360 --> 00:01:14,230
Play free in your browser at krazow.github.io/islandtime

